{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203420","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203420","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320342001:1":{"text":"大叔，别紧张。这位亡——唔，这位活死人，是我们的朋友，柳博米尔！","source_cn":"大叔，别紧张。这位亡——唔，这位活死人，是我们的朋友，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65B4DA56C13B566D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320342002:1":{"text":"没错，他是个好人！不仅买下了列夫斯基最后那幅画，还帮忙修复了破损的部分。","source_cn":"没错，他是个好人！不仅买下了列夫斯基最后那幅画，还帮忙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A8DB31E105BE72D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320342003:1":{"text":"原来您就是那位好心的艺术家……真没想到，您竟然会是一位活死人……","source_cn":"原来您就是那位好心的艺术家……真没想到，您竟然会是一位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6AC9C792CF6512","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320342004:1":{"text":"很抱歉，吓到你了。","source_cn":"很抱歉，吓到你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AA65DAC3D82AE22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320342005:1":{"text":"如果不是那个商人说了那么令人讨厌的话，我不会现身的。","source_cn":"如果不是那个商人说了那么令人讨厌的话，我不会现身的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD71F6E8D800DD1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do