斯基……","source_cn":"我也很想留下这幅画……可留下它又有什么用呢？我们一家只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC20901E365F1D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320342016:1":{"text":"但要是卖掉它，我们一家至少能维持生计，总有法子还上债，继续生活下去的……","source_cn":"但要是卖掉它，我们一家至少能维持生计，总有法子还上债，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7B5DFFEAD169231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1320342016":{"text":"但要是卖掉它，我们一家至少能维持生计，总有法子还上债，继续生活下去的……","source_cn":"但要是卖掉它，我们一家至少能维持生计，总有法子还上债，继续生活下去的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7B5DFFEAD169231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320342017:0":{"text":"谢谢……谢谢您能体谅我……","source_cn":"谢谢……谢谢您能体谅我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7455EE70BF0321C3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"谢谢……谢谢您能体谅我……","female":"谢谢……谢谢您能体谅我……","variant_male_record_index":"144513","variant_female_record_index":"144514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1320342019:1":{"text":"好吧……大叔做出这个选择一定很艰难，满满能理解！","source_cn":"好吧……大叔做出这个选择一定很艰难，满满能理解！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A5F428D438E62E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1320342020:1":{"text":"那……柳博米尔，你愿意帮